Note = {2nd International Symposium on Test Automation and Instrumentation,
   Beijing, PEOPLES R CHINA, NOV 17-21, 2008},
Organization = {China Instrumentat \& Control Soc; Natl Nat Sci Fdn China; Silicon
   Valley Sci \& Technol Assoc; CIS Measurement \& Instrument Comm; Beijing
   Informat Sci \& Technol Univ; Journal Elect Measurement \& Instrument},
Abstract = {Focusing to the special requirements of independence and precision of
   the navigation system in the maneuvering launch vehicles, an independent
   navigation program was presented in which the strap-down inertia
   navigation system was aided by geomagnetism matching, odometer and
   altimeter. The model of independent and high precision navigation system
   was established. Based on a typical movement track of the maneuvering
   launch vehicle, system's federal filtering algorithm with Unscented
   Kalman Filter as sub-filter was designed. Being proved by the simulation
   results under a same track condition, the proposed navigation algorithm
   maintains pleasant filtering and information fusion effect and also a
   reliable filtering convergence. The navigation precision was
   dramatically improved.},
