Abstract = {Before final assembly and while debugging a missile, in order to ensure
   the flight control system can work stably and reliably, it is necessary
   to develop an auto test system for a general performance test, including
   electrical performance, inertial measurement device and navigation
   accuracy. After describing the composition and working principle of the
   flight control system, summarizing the test requirements, this paper
   puts forward to a test plan based on a industrial computer, introduces
   the hardware design and hardware anti-jamming techniques in detail. The
   test system with self-test function has been applied in testing the
   flight control system generally and reliably.},
