   Soc China; Chinese Assoc Artificial Intelligence; Chinese Assoc Automat,
   Tech Comm Control Theory; Northeastern Univ},
Abstract = {The terminal guidance system of a missile is nonlinear. Therefore,
   traditional performance analysis methods of terminal guidance system are
   numerical. However, numerical methods have limitations in performance
   analysis. The bandwidth analytic expression is derived in this paper to
   analyze its principal influence factors. Then a new approach based on
   the bandwidth is present in this paper to analyze the performance of
   terminal guidance system followed by its applications in guidance and
   control. And the feasibility of this approach is proved by simulation.
   The result shows that this approach has advantages in performance
