   AUG 17-18, 2013},
Organization = {ISRC; Henan Inst Engn; Anhui Polytechn Univ; Inner Mongolia Agr Univ;
   Zhejiang A\&F Univ},
Abstract = {In order to let the missile run according to a predetermined track and
   accuracy in certain external environment, we need calculate real-time
   heading information of integration navigation. An embedded integrated
   navigation system based on DSP and FPGA was developed by the combination
   of data solution computer, data acquisition and interface circuit, micro
   inertial measurement unit and GPS receiver. Algorithms and software
   programs of integrated navigation was designed. The superiority of data
   fusion algorithm of integrated navigation than pure inertial navigation
   system was tested by Software simulation. The car test shows that
   navigation system can achieve real-time accurate navigation information
   output. Also, there are very broad application prospects of the
   integrated navigation system based on DSP + FPGA in the areas such as
   missile-borne, airborne and shipboard systems.},
