Number = {3},
Pages = {310-316},
Month = {JUN},
Abstract = {The imaging technology of Infrared focal plane array (FPA) detector is a
   method which converts the thermal radiation of the target into the
   visible image. It is widely used in target seeking, missile guidance and
   space exploration, etc. For the requirements of small volume and fast
   cool-down application in missile guidance, an infrared FPA imaging
   guidance system was designed, including the catadioptric infrared lens,
   fast cool-down IRFPA detector, and low noise image circuit. The whole
   system satisfies the imaging requirements of the missile guidance.},
