   Jiaotong Univ; Chinese Acad Sci, Acad Math \& Syst Sci; China Soc Indu
   \& Appl Math; Univ Elect Sci \& Technol China; Sichuan Univ; Asian
   Control Assocn; IEEE Control Syst Soc; Inst Control Robot \& Syst; Soc
   Instrument \& Control Engineers; Sichuan Soc Automat \& Instrument},
Abstract = {Strapdown homing technology is of great significance to the
   miniaturization, low-cost and high-reliability of guided munitions and
   is applied more and more to short-range miniature munitions
   successfully. The extraction of inertial LOS(line of sight) rate from
   strapdown seeker detecting information and missile attitude is the focus
   of this technology. Theoretical decoupling model of inertial LOS angle
   from detecting LOS information and missile attitude information was
   established, as well as its rolling stabilizing simplified form. Based
   on downward-looking scheme, the problem of seeker's small view field was
   solved. The inertial LOS rate directly used for proportional navigation
   guidance law was estimated by the mean of TD(tracking differentiator),
   and a synthetic guidance system was designed. Digital simulation results
   show that the proposed method can achieve the precise guidance of a
   short-range miniature munition, which has definite value in engineering.},
