   Sect IAS Chapter},
Abstract = {In order to improve navigation accuracy and anti -jamming capability,
   designed ``CDMA + INS{''} navigation system. The system uses INS data to
   determine the reference trajectory. CDMA collects data independently,
   gets TDOA information from the reference position of INS. Get the
   precise position based on TDOA algorithm; adjust the accumulation error
   of INS; achieve the characteristics of high concealment performance,
   good survivable ability, economical and practical advantage. This paper
   made a simulation in part of the system how to get TDOA information from
   the CDMA pilot signal, the experimental results proved that positioning
   by CDMA pilot signal, can make INS positioning accuracy increased by
   50\%, the passive location way also has advantages of good concealed
   performance and strong invulnerability ability. The simulation results
   provides theory basis for ``CDMA + INS{''} navigation system applied to
   cruise missiles, TBM and UAV weapons system.},
