Abstract = {Exo-atmospheric Interceptor with pulse thruster was researched. Firstly,
   considering with the measurement noise of rotation rate of LOS (line of
   sight) and error of estimating relative distance between missile and
   target, the LOS rate was predicted by the state, control input,
   measurement noise of LOS and estimation error of relative distance on
   current moment. Secondly, the On-Off guidance law was designed on the
   base of predictive control, optimization problem of the On-Off guidance
   law was given, and On-Off curve was derived. Thirdly, stabilization of
