   for three-dimensional missile guidance system under maneuvering target
   with consideration of second-order autopilot dynamics. The proposed
   guidance law not only guarantees the azimuth rate and elevation rate of
   guidance system converge to zero in finite time but also ensures the
   continuity of control action. Simulations of a practical interception
   process under complex maneuvering target are carried and the simulation
