Organization = {IEEE},
Abstract = {The flight control system is the most important system of a launch
   vehicle, so strict and comprehensive tests must be carried out on it. As
   for the control system of a new type of launch vehicle, it brings more
   signals and information than before. In order to ensure the reliability
   of data acquisition and real-time processing of testing information, a
   new method of concerted multi-card acquisition and testing Information
   processing is presented in this paper. In particular, a software based
   adjustable frequency sampling and storage method for analog signals is
   introduced in detail. Corresponding test system has been developed and
   applied to real launch task, and testing conflicts are avoided, testing
   flexibility is improved.},
