Abstract = {The specific guidance simulation system for the infrared air-to-air
   missile is built. Seeker model including the target detection and
   tracking loop has simulated not only the different modes of field of
   view (FOV) according to the geometrical relationship between the target
   and missile, but also the jamming effect based on the equivalent target
   calculation; fuze model contains three different trigger mechanisms;
   guidance of missile is realized via three-dimensional proportional
   guidance law; the 6 DOF kinematics model and dynamic model of airframe
   are derived, through aerodynamic force and torque calculating,
   triple-channel autopilot model is set up by using the PID control
   method. Finally simulations under three different cases are implemented
   and the results show that the whole system is credible.},
