   Control Res Ctr; Korea Aerosp Res Inst},
Abstract = {In this paper, an real-time suboptimal midcourse guidance law robust to
   missile launch conditions, which is a neural network approximation of
   the optimal feedback strategy, is proposed. It is obtained by the
   appropriate representation of input data of the neural network, which
   guarantees robustness. Computer simulations show that the proposed
