Abstract = {In this paper the RLV flight control system is designed by combining MPC
   with Feedback Linearization (FBL). The feedback linearization is based
   on the full rotational equations of motion rather than on a conventional
   model derived from time-scale separation. Input state constraints and
   are applied to MPC algorithms to avoid input saturations, to guarantee a
   smooth tracking performance with non-linear rotational dynamics and a
   strong roll-yaw coupling of RLV model. The results of simulation show
   the control system can follow the parameters of guidance significantly.},
