Month = {NOV-DEC},
Abstract = {The problem of synthesis of a stochastic terminal control with a known
   moment of termination is considered. The process of controlled approach
   of an aircraft to a maneuvering object is an interpretation of this
   problem. The specificity of this problem consists in the application of
   two acting forces: aerodynamic and gas dynamic. A method for a
   suboptimal solution, which takes into account practical constraints
   imposed on these forces, is proposed, and the potential accuracy of the
   synthesized control system is estimated.},
