   Global Union Acad Sci \& Technol},
Abstract = {This paper investigates the guidance and control problem for missile
   with the seeker mounted in the side window. To effectively coordinate
   the flight trajectory and attitude of missile, expand the detection
   range of target and enhance guidance accuracy, a novel guidance law
   based on the adaptive technique is proposed. And the navigation ratio
   changes adaptively as the missile leadangle varies. Numerical simulation
   results show that the applicability of adaptive proportional navigation
   is wider than that of parallel navigation and conventional proportional
   navigation, thus, the guidance law proposed in this paper has a better
   combination property.},
