   Technology; Tiangong University; Tianjin University of Science \&
   Technology; Civil Aviation University of China; Tianjin Association of
   Automation},
Abstract = {In order to eliminate the influence of radome refraction on the line of
   sight (LOS) angle, a new radome multiple reference model based SRUKF
   filter is proposed to estimate the radome slope. The proposed method
   corrects the measurement of LOS angle by two-step filtering, which can
   effectively address the issues of insufficient measured data and
   uncertain variance of the radome slope. Simulation results show that
   this method can estimate the radome slope effectively, as well as
   improve the accuracy of the guidance system.},
