   Hochschule Offenburg Univ Appl Sci; Res Publishing},
Abstract = {Gyroscopes are used in the navigation system of Launch Vehicles for
   estimating its instantaneous position on the trajectory path during
   flight. Similar low cost gyroscope devices can be used in sounding
   rockets also for estimating their spin rate, attitude etc. This paper
   explains the algorithm to extract angular rate over SPI interface from
   ADXRS450, which is a MEMS based gyroscope operating on resonator
   gyroscope principle. The sensor digital output will give the error free
   data even in noisy conditions. PIC microcontroller is used to read the
   data from the sensor and send to checkout. LabVIEW software running on
   the computer will extract and display the data from the serial port at
   real time.},
