Abstract = {The high precision of the seeker is the key to reduce the Miss-Distance
   and improve precision in the guidance system of missile, and the seeker
   stabilized platform servo system is safeguard of the overall performance
   of seeker. So based on the Stribeck friction model, this paper studies
