Abstract = {To improve accuracy of artillery rocket is a crucial problem especially
   for long-range multiple launch rocket system. A kind of simplified
   control system can control the rocket during boost phase, but cannot
   compensate for disturbance during coast phase. In this paper, a guidance
   and control system making use of low cost IMU/GPS (Inertial Measurement
   Unit/Global Positioning System) is introduced, by which disturbance
   during both phase can be restricted. Guidance adds extra cost to the
   rocket but is more than offset by increased effectiveness.},
