   ELECTR NETWORK, JAN 03-07, 2022},
Organization = {AIAA},
Abstract = {This paper illustrates the use and advancements made to the Tactical
   Missile Design spreadsheet, a conceptual sizing tool for rapid
   first-order design of tactical missiles. The program enables the
   practitioner to quickly generate estimates between a variety of
   propulsion and guidance systems for analysis pertaining to sizing,
   flight performance, and other measures of merit. The fidelity of this
   tool empowers the user to perform fast trade-studies and identify the
   performance drivers of a system. Advancements to this tool encompasses
   baseline data for turbojet missiles and guided bombs in addition to
   updating the previously incorporated data for rocket and ramjet
   missiles.},
