   Sci \& Technol},
Abstract = {Control of electric actuator using brushless DC motors for tactical
   missiles is introduced in this paper. The electric actuator is a key
   part of the flight control system. A new kind of PD controller is
   implemented which is different from the traditional ones. The proportion
   reacts immediately to the error. And the differentiation function works
   on the feedback of the system in order to predict the future output and
   restrain the overshoot. The simulation and experiment results verify its
   excellent dynamic and static performances. Finally the test methods for
   evaluating the dynamic and static characteristics are provided.},
