Organization = {Singapore Inst Elect},
Abstract = {The accuracy and real-time of modern missile flight control system of
   traditional aerodynamic can not be satisfied. In this paper a new method
   is presented to improve the accuracy and real-time of missiles under
   this condition. First of all, a missile sub-channel model of the dynamic
   equations and steering gear is established, then based on the
   established model, using PID controller to control steering gear and
   three channels of missile pitch, yaw, roll respectively which is called
   missile sub-channel PID control method, and finally making use of
   MATLAB/Simulink to complete the simulation. Simulation results show that
   compared with traditional aerodynamic control system, this method can
   reduce the response time of aerodynamic missile and enhance the
   stability of the control system obviously.},
