   Univ China, Key Lab Instrumentat Sci \& Dynam Measurement, Minist Educ;
   Natl Key Lab Elect Measurement Technol, Taiyuan Div; Candidate State Key
   Lab Dynam Measurement; Dalian Univ Tehnol, State Key Lab Coastal \&
   Offshore Engn; NUC, Dept Elect Sci \& Technol},
Abstract = {A new time-variable nonlinear predictive filtering method is presented
   in the paper. The modeling error is assumed unknown in the method and is
   estimated as part of the solution. It can be used online to both filter
   noisy measurements and estimate state trajectories. The time variable
   parameter system is considered in the algorithm, so that it can be used
   to the nonlinear time variable system and it is most important advantage
   of the filter over other conventional predictive filtering method. As an
   example the algorithm is used to estimate the states of a missile
   guidance system, simulation results show the new predictive filtering
   method provides accurate estimations in the presence of highly nonlinear
   dynamics and significant errors and time variety in model parameters.},
