   Univ China, Key Lab Instrumentat Sci \& Dynam Measurement, Minist Educ;
   Natl Key Lab Elect Measurement Technol, Taiyuan Div; Candidate State Key
   Lab Dynam Measurement; Dalian Univ Tehnol, State Key Lab Coastal \&
   Offshore Engn; NUC, Dept Elect Sci \& Technol},
Abstract = {Initial state information especially roll angle will be lost at launch
   for the integrated GPS/INS guided artillery rocket. An algorithm to
   estimate the roll angle is deduced according to motion equations of
   rockets and principle of Least Squares Estimate (LSE). GPS velocity
   measurements and three axis rate gyros measurements are used to obtain
   roll information imbedded in pitch and yaw axis rate gyros. Furthermore,
   performance of this algorithm is analyzed in the presence of various
   error sources. Simulation results show that its precision can satisfy
   the preliminary estimation of the roll angle.},
