   Harbin, PEOPLES R CHINA, AUG 05-07, 2022},
Organization = {Harbin Engineering University},
Abstract = {Saturation attack strategy has attracted wide attention because it plays
   an important role in missiles penetration tasks. In this context, this
   paper proposes a novel cooperative proportional navigation guidance law
   to accomplish multi-missiles salvo attack in a planar scenario. At
   first, the cooperative planar engagement dynamic is formulated. The
   time-to-go estimates is selected as the coordination variable and then
   the finite time converged time cooperative guidance law is designed via
   multi-agents control theory. The setting time of guidance system is
   bounded and independent of the initial condition. This guarantees
   multi-missiles final salvo attack. The finite-time consensus and
   stability analysis are constructed via the Lyapunov function. Finally,
   the numerical simulations illustrate the performance of proposed
   guidance law and the proposed guidance law has good trajectories
   characteristics like traditional PNG law.},
