   and Kishimoto, Motohisa and Kogure, Satoshi and Sawabe, Mikio and
   Terada, Koji and Kurosu, Koichi and Okamoto, Takeshi},
Book-Group-Author = {INST NAVIGATION},
Title = {QZSS System Design and Initial Performance Verification},
