   Soc},
Abstract = {In order to simultaneously achieve high maneuverability and lowest
   off-target for the wrestle air-to-air missile, a hybrid BTT/STT
   autopilot is proposed. According to BTT control good turning ability in
   big angle-of-attack and STT control excellent accuracy in small
   angle-of-attack, whom would be chose on the basis of overlod command
   given by guidance system. We changed overload command into correlative
   angle instruction, then built a two-step controller based on dynamic
   inversion algorithm, together with actuators and missile dynamics to
   constitute a hybrid BTT/STT autopilot. The simulation results show that
   this autopilot can precisely track overload command during the whole
   flight process, simultaneously satisfy agile turning of big
   angle-of-attack in starting trajectory and high control precision in
   terminal guidance.},
