Note = {Asia-Pacific International Symposium on Aerospace Technology, Xian,
   PEOPLES R CHINA, SEP 13-15, 2010},
Organization = {NW Polytechn Univ; AVIC First Aircraft Design \& Res Inst; AVIC Aircraft
   Strength Res Inst},
Abstract = {In order to improve transfer alignment precision and speed of missile
   onboard helicopter, the errors arising out of the time delayed of data
   transmission from master to slave INS and lever arm have been considered
   and compensated. With deduced the differential equations which including
   time delay variable and adopted an advanced ``velocity+attitude{''}
   information matching method, A Kalman filter model of transfer alignment
   scheme has been built. Aim to satisfy the requirement of helicopter and
   weapon system, the paper puts forward a new maneuver manner for
   helicopter to transfer alignment, The simulation results show that the
   performance of the transfer alignment is great improved due to the
   compensation. Within 10 seconds, the three misalignment angles error is
   less than 3'. Alignment speed and precision satisfy the combat
   requirement of missile onboard helicopter. Compared with traditional
   method, the maneuver manner presented by the paper has some advantages,
   such as simplification, easily realization and fit for helicopter.},
