   other aerospace technologies. The paper first describes technological
   advances in Navigation, Guidance and Control (NGC) system, and
   Telemetry, Tracking and Command (TTC) system, the two basic functional
   blocks of launch vehicle electronics, in early 70s to meet the demands
   of India's first launch vehicle SLV-3. It, then, describes the. advances
