Abstract = {This paper presents the concept of virtual instrumentation and its
   importance in test and evaluation of launch vehicle avionics. The
   experiences at the Vikram Sarabhai Space Centre (VSSC) with virtual
   instrumentation systems, highlighting the virtual instrumentation-based
   checkout systems of pyro current monitoring package and video image
   processing unit are presented. The virtual instrumentation system-based
   checkouts present cost-effective, compact, and user-friendly
   human-machine interfaces for the test and evaluation of these packages.
