   Smart Modular Technologies; Eldorado; Assoc Brasileira Ind Semicond;
   Inmarsat; Fundacao Amparo Pesquisa Estado Sao Paulo; CAPES; SiDi; SENAI},
Abstract = {Sounding rockets are essential for scientific and technological
   development. They are a relatively brief and not-so-expensive form of
   access to space. Rocket avionics is very complex and has many interfaces
   with ground crews before launch. Simplifying data exchange and making it
   more reliable and efficient is always very important. In this work, an
   IoT-based telemetry system for sounding rockets is proposed. Such
   architecture is expected to make data exchange and launch operation more
   efficient. The adaptations to achieve this goal are presented as well as
   the results of a proof of concept carried out with Heltec's LoRa 32
   radio platform. The preliminary results of this work showed that an
   IoT-based telemetry can be used in sounding rocket projects, being able
   to successfully transmit and receive data.},
