   PEOPLES R CHINA, JUN 01-03, 2001},
Organization = {Chinese Soc Modern Tech Equipment},
Abstract = {this paper presents the solution of frequency-dividing locked in phase
   telemetry transmitter through the constraint of the technique method to
   FM transmitter. On the basis of mathematical analysis to the frequency
   stability locked in phase principle and FM characteristics the paper
   propose that we should adopt monolithic circuit to realize high
   frequency stability wide modulation frequency deviation low power
   consumption and small volume telemetry transmitter Meanwhile the
   performance parameter of transmitter principle prototype is given.
   Theoretical analysis and actual test results prove that
   frequency-dividing locked in phase telemetry transmitter could meet the
   demands of high precision dynamic measurement for conventional missile
   \& launch vehicle telemetry The method has important guiding
   significance to the design of modularization and miniaturization of on
   board telemetry equipment.},
