   Engineers, Goa Sect; SICE; Engineers India Ltd},
Abstract = {The avionics systems in launch vehicles carry out a large number of
   mission critical functions such as navigation guidance control and
   sequencing. It is necessary that such systems are built with redundancy
   features to eliminate the single point failures. This paper presents the
   redundancy aspects used in mission critical avionics of Indian Satellite
   launch vehicles. The failure detection isolation and reconfiguration
   philisophy used in onboard hardware/software are discussed. The
   validation methodology used to evaluate the redundancy aspects are also
   highlighted.},
