   FL, APR 17-18, 2023},
Organization = {IEEE},
Abstract = {A robust TM system is proposed for future generation of launch vehicles
   based on the retrodirective principle. The TM system is compatible for
   challenging environments, which includes high variation in attitude and
   acceleration of the platform. The system shows fast tracking with update
   rate of up to 167 Hz. The proposed system provides full 360 degrees
   field of view coverage to maintain the link.},
