Number = {2},
Pages = {206-215},
Month = {MAR},
Abstract = {This review paper discusses the evolution of Integrated Modular Avionics
   (IMA) architecture for aerospace applications and the adoption of IMA in
   missile applications. It provides an overview of the traditional
   Federated Architecture and also explains the concept of Integrated
   Modular Avionics (IMA) architecture. The paper also discusses about the
   design, implementation, methodology, and compares the pros and cons of
   both architectures. It also highlights the characteristics of IMA, the
   design challenges, and how these challenges are overcome by providing
   solutions. The methods adopted in building IMA systems and the
   improvements made are clearly explained. This review paper presents the
   results of a pilot implementation and provides recommendations for
   future adoption of this technology in missile applications. The paper
   also discusses about the lessons learned from various commercial IMA
   systems (worldwide), these learnings can be adopted for successful IMA
   system development for military applications.},
