Organization = {IEEE},
Abstract = {The new circuit based on the FPGA was developed to design the data
   acqusition system for the missile telemetry and telecontrol. The design
   overcame many disadvantages which was brought by the traditional
   circuits based on the MCU or DSP. Meanwhile, the three-rank sequence
   collected method was invented in the circuit, so the system's analog
   signals collected capacity was increased greatly, also the circuit bulk
   was decreased efficiently and the reliability of circuit was increased
   remarkably. At last, the emulational result and experimentation in the
   whole missile system validated the circuit's feasibility.},
