Abstract = {In the aerospace measuring and controlling area, especially in rocket
   telemetry receiver system, polarization diversity is used to fight
   against polarization signal fading, improve channel reliability and
   improve the quality of the received signal. Firstly, mathematical models
   of phase-locked loop, differential mode loop and common loop were
   demenstrated. Then, theoretical analysis was given in detail and the
   results indicated that interaction of differential mode loop and common
   mode loop the carrier capture and telemetry demodulation function can be
   finished, which can provide theoretical support for further analyzing,
   simulating and designing diversity symmetric phase-locked loop.},
