Organization = {Inst Elect \& Elect Engineers; IEEE Antennas \& Propagat Soc; APS},
Abstract = {In the Skyward Experimental Rocketry framework, a student managed
   project, the aim of this paper is the design of an innovative antenna
   for a telemetry system that has to be mounted on a experimental rocket
   that has to be designed in order to establish the new European altitude
   record for student rocketry. In particular the antenna here considered
   has to be mounted on a low cost rocket, Roxanne I, in order to send and
   receive data from a micro-controlled circuit on-board to a base-station
   on the ground, to ensure the safety and the effectiveness of the control
   of the whole system. The experimental results of the rocket launch, now
