   exoatmospheric and includes regions with negligible geomagnetic
   shielding, especially during geomagnetic storms. It is therefore
   necessary to harden TABMs against galactic cosmic ray (GCR) and solar
   particle event (SPE) induced single event effects (SEEs) and star
   tracker and focal plane array (FPA) glitches. The variability of the
