   Inst; CIC Commun \& Signal Proc Soc; Univ Minist Educ China, Program
   Innovat Res Team},
Abstract = {This paper researched a kind of cylindrically conformal microstrip patch
   antenna array with series feed network for the telemetry application on
   missile. The design procedure of feed network of the conformal
   microstrip patch antenna is simple, which suitable for the research and
   development of the large scale conformal antenna array. The required
   amplitude and phase excitations of the conformal antenna elements were
   realized by designing the dimension parameters of the series feed
   network. In order to reveal the proposed feed method, a cylindrically
   conformal microstrip patch antenna array with five elements was designed
   and simulated by using the full wave electromagnetic simulation
   software, and the specific simulation results were provided. The
   simulated voltage standing wave ratio (VSWR) was lower than 2 within the
   frequency range of from 2.24GHz to 2.26GHz. The simulated gains at
   considered space range can satisfy the requirements. The proposed design
   method of series feed method for the conformal antenna array can provide
   a reference for the practical engineering application.},
