Abstract = {According to the setting problem of satellite elevation mask of rocket
   onboard GPS real-time positioning, the influence of defilade angle on
   carrier rocked positioning precision is analyzed, and furthermore, the
   dynamics calculate method of satellite elevation mask based on the
   observable lowest elevation is put forward. Tested using the actual task
