   Harbin, PEOPLES R CHINA, AUG 05-07, 2022},
Organization = {Harbin Engineering University},
Abstract = {In the process of carrier flight, measurement data containing outliers
   have a great impact on target localization and flight safety, especially
   for speckle-type outliers, improper processing will attribute to bias in
   the accuracy of target flight status and flight safety assessment, thus,
   technical means have to be used to correct them. In this paper, based on
   the least squares method, we introduce the idea of fault tolerance, and
   establish the fault-tolerant least squares speckle-type outlier
   diagnosis and repair algorithm through fault-tolerant processing,
   suspicious point screening, diagnosis and repair modeling, and give the
   application effect and main results of the algorithm, and illustrate the
   effectiveness of the method through examples.},
