Booktitle = {SPACE TECHNOLOGY AND APPLICATIONS INTERNATIONAL FORUM, PTS 1-3: 1ST
   CONFERENCE ON FUTURE SCIENCE \& EARTH SCIENCE MISSIONS; 1ST CONFERENCE
   ON SYNERGISTIC POWER \& PROPULSION SYSTEMS TECHNOLOGY; 1ST CONFERENCE ON
