   Shintaro and Miyoshi, Kota and Hirose, Chikako and Kikuchi, Junji and
   Bando, Nobutaka and Morishita, Naoki and Tomiki, Atsushi and Torii,
   Wataru and Ito, Taichi and Otsuki, Masatsugu and Yoshimitsu, Tetsuo and
   Ishige, Yasuo and Takeuchi, Hiroshi and Yamamoto, Yukio},
